<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to auction 3yr bonds of HUF15bln on Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Hungary to auction 3yr bonds of HUF15bln on Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction three-year government bonds, 1999/D series, worth nominally 15 billion forints on November 21, the Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said on Wednesday in a statement.</p>
<p>    Date of issue		 31 October, 1996</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	    24 October, 1999</p>
<p>    Bills on offer		15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Minimum net price	   97.85 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The 1999/D bonds bear a fixed interest of annual 21 percent, to be paid twice a year, on April 24 and October 24.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
